<blockquote>
<p>Nothing in life is to be feared. It is to be understood.</p>
<p>- Marie Curie</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The clichés I've chosen for this are:</p>
<ul>
<li>Spooky scary murder monster.</li>
<li>An anomaly so helpful/harmless, the Foundation lets it roam the Site and has minimal containment procedures.</li>
<li>A doorway of any shape to a different dimension/timeline/world (not sure if this counts but oh well).</li>
</ul>
<p>This is probably the most ambitious article I've written so far, hopefully it sticks well.</p>
